        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cleo Demetriou, Sophia Kiely, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo, Sophia Dall'aglio, Kerry Ingram, Eleanor Worthington Cox\n- TV Shows: So Awkward, CBBC\n- Roles: Lily Hampton, Jas (Jasmine) Salford, Martha Fitzgerald\n- Songs and Films: Made of Paper, Mache Man\n\nFacts:\n- Cleo Demetriou appeared in the CBBC show \"So Awkward\" as Lily Hampton.\n- \"So Awkward\" stars Cleo Demetriou as Lily Hampton, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo as Jas (Jasmine) Salford, and Sophia Dall'aglio as Martha Fitzgerald.\n- Cleo Demetriou sang \"Made of Paper,\" a soundtrack accompanying the short film \"Mache Man.\"\n- Sophia Kiely shared a role with Cleo Demetriou, Kerry Ingram, and Eleanor Worthington Cox.",
